The BASE64, BASE32 and BASE16 lines in rfc4648.txt are copied verbatim from RFC 4648
(https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4648.txt, fetched 2026-10-25, sha256
84e14418f795d503be5f34bf23ce4ebaa119e9ec7c9f667d8caeb111385b178f), section 10. Section 15
places section 10 under Simon Josefsson's copying conditions. The RFC's notices, verbatim:

